",
  "intent": "The Intent is <id>
  status     open
",
  "keys backup": "The backup is in <home>/ada.backup
  holds      4 keys, of did:oip:<mind>
  sealed     with the backup's own passphrase: without it, nothing of it can be read
Keep the file and its passphrase apart from this machine, and from each other.
",
  "keys restore": "The mind is did:oip:<mind>
  keys       restored to <home>/restored/keys, and sealed afresh
  log        5 events
  signs      yes: the backup holds a key the mind signs with now
  identity   can change: the backup holds the control keys the log commits to
What the mind's client remembered is not restored: publish where it is with \`oip publish location\`.
",
  "offer": "The Offer is <id>
