",
  "verify": "Commitment <id>
  ok         it is a well-formed Commitment (core 2.1)
  ok         proof 0 is a good signature by the key <key> (core 5.4)
  ok         proof 1 is a good signature by the key <key> (core 5.4)
  ok         proof 0 is by a key of did:oip:<mind> that was valid at <time> (L1 6.1)
  ok         proof 1 is by a key of did:oip:<mind> that was valid at <time> (L1 6.1)
  ok         it counts for did:oip:<mind> (L2 7.1)
  ok         it counts for did:oip:<mind> (L2 7.1)
It verifies.
",
}
